# Built harnesses. A PATTERN, not a list of names.
#
# This file used to name kat_harness, kat_harness_deg_down and kat_harness_deg_up literally. The
# build then grew two more arms -- kat_harness_good_dn and kat_harness_good_up, the ~2^-45
# positive controls -- and nothing covered them, so two 115KB ELF binaries were committed.
# Build them yourself with tools/build_and_selftest.sh; this repo ships source and vectors only.
kat_harness*
!kat_harness.c

*.o
*.exe
__pycache__/
